# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — Roof Segmentation / Few-Shot Comparison
# =============================================================================
#
# What we commit:
#   - README.md (the project plan)
#   - scripts/, src/, tests/, notebooks/ (code)
#   - patches/ (~15 MB, the dataset-of-record — see README § Preprocessing)
#
# What we do NOT commit:
#   - data/ — the 5000×5000 source TIFFs are local-only. They will be
#     removed entirely once patches/ is finalized and visually verified.
#   - results/ — per-attempt training artifacts (checkpoints, histories,
#     overlays). Reproducible from code + patches/, so no reason to carry.
#   - Python, editor, and OS cruft.
# =============================================================================

# Source data — local only, not part of the repo
data/

# Training run artifacts — regenerable, kept out of version control
results/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Jupyter / Colab
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
